# CareerOS — Phase 4: Unified Intelligent Course Generator

## ROLE

You are acting as a **senior full-stack architect and engineer** implementing Phase 4 of CareerOS.

Phase 1 established the architecture.
Phase 2 unified authentication.
Phase 3 unified MongoDB persistence and ownership.

Phase 4 is now specifically about:

> **Consolidating and upgrading the Course Generator into one coherent, production-quality, intelligent learning-course generation system.**

The existing repository contains multiple Course Generator implementations. Do NOT blindly rewrite everything.

The goal is to:

1. Preserve working functionality.
2. Reuse the strongest existing components.
3. Remove architectural duplication only after the canonical path works.
4. Implement the intended Course Generator workflow described below.
5. Keep MongoDB as the durable source of truth.
6. Keep Phase 2 authentication unchanged.
7. Keep Phase 3 ownership/persistence contracts compatible.
8. Produce a reliable, explainable, high-quality generated course.

