# 3. TARGET PRODUCT EXPERIENCE

The Course Generator should ultimately behave like this:

```text
User
 ↓
Enter Course Name
 ↓
CareerOS generates personalized questions
 ↓
User answers questions
 ↓
CareerOS summarizes/shows the interpreted requirements
 ↓
User reviews the answers
 ↓
Generate Course
 ↓
AI Course Generation Pipeline
 ↓
Course Preview
 ↓
User reviews complete course
 ↓
 ┌──────────────────────┐
 │ Save Course           │
 └──────────────────────┘
 ↓
MongoDB
 ↓
My Courses
 ↓
Learn
 ↓
Progress tracking
 ↓
Resume from where user stopped
```

The generated course should NOT automatically become a durable saved course merely because the AI finished generating it.

The intended product behavior is:

> **Generate → Preview → User decides → Save → Persist**

Unless an existing technical constraint makes this impossible, implement this behavior.

